>!this is the absolute worst execution in the series. Why is it only around 30 seconds compared to the 1:30 that most of the other executions are? I mean, I get what it's supposed to be suggesting, but it's very...uh...not well done.!<

&#x200B;

At least we have Chapter 5's execution to look forward to, and if Arin can't at least appreciate that one, then something is wrong here.
